WEBVTT

00:13:28.781 --> 00:13:30.188
bar ne za sada.

00:13:30.188 --> 00:13:34.564
Ipak, ako postavite pitanje,
vaš doktor će verovatno

00:13:34.564 --> 00:13:36.846
potražiti odgovor.

00:13:36.846 --> 00:13:39.183
Ovo je toliko važno,

00:13:39.183 --> 00:13:41.515
ne samo za nas same,

00:13:41.515 --> 00:13:43.998
već i za sve one koje volimo,

00:13:43.998 --> 00:13:48.482
bilo da je to majka, ćerka, sestra,

00:13:48.482 --> 00:13:52.359
prijatelj ili baka.

00:13:52.359 --> 00:13:54.322
Patnja moje bake

00:13:54.322 --> 00:13:56.255
je inspirisala moj rad

00:13:56.255 --> 00:13:59.240
na poboljšanju zdravlja žena.

00:13:59.240 --> 00:14:01.700
To je njeno zaveštanje.